{
  "note": "a key store whose first chain violates the JDK's algorithm constraints (jdk.certpath.disabledAlgorithms: an MD5-signed leaf, a 512-bit RSA key) next to a good key: the key manager skips it and the good key connects. The stores are made by tests/files/asyncapi/mqtt-ssl/key-choice/make-constraints.sh",
  "properties": {
    "tlsMutualAuthenticationRequired": "true",
    "tlsMutualAuthenticationCertificateChain": "{{files}}/tls/private-ca/ca-cert.pem"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "note": "the broker: every binary message this server receives (after its TLS, which requires a client certificate issued by its tlsMutualAuthenticationCertificateChain, a private CA, and names that CA in its CertificateRequest) but a lone zero byte is answered with an MQTT CONNACK, so a load connects exactly when the client presents a certificate the server accepts",
      "method": "PUT",
      "path": "/mockserver/expectation",
      "body": {
        "httpRequest": {
          "binaryData": "AA==",
          "not": true
        },
        "binaryResponse": {
          "binaryData": "IAMAAAA="
        }
      },
      "mask": [
        "\"id\" : \"[0-9a-f-]+\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "note": "probe md5-good SunX509",
      "method": "PUT",
      "path": "/mockserver/asyncapi",
      "body": {
        "spec": {
          "asyncapi": "2.6.0",
          "info": {
            "title": "Ssl",
            "version": "1"
          },
          "channels": {
            "orders": {
              "publish": {
                "message": {
                  "payload": {
                    "type": "object"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "brokerConfig": {
          "mqttBrokerUrl": "ssl://localhost:{{port}}",
          "publishOnLoad": false,
          "mqttSecurity": {
            "sslProperties": {
              "com.ibm.ssl.keyStore": "{{files}}/asyncapi/mqtt-ssl/key-choice/md5-good.p12",
              "com.ibm.ssl.keyStorePassword": "changeit",
              "com.ibm.ssl.trustStore": "{{files}}/asyncapi/mqtt-ssl/trust.jks",
              "com.ibm.ssl.trustStorePassword": "changeit"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "maxMillis": 60000
    },
    {
      "note": "probe md5-good NewSunX509",
      "method": "PUT",
      "path": "/mockserver/asyncapi",
      "body": {
        "spec": {
